{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":42,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["主的僕人"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"「看啊，我所扶持、所揀選、所喜悅的僕人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已將我的靈賜給祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必將正義帶給萬邦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂不喧嚷，不呼喊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不在街上高聲說話。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"壓傷的蘆葦，祂不折斷；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將殘的燈火，祂不吹滅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必信實地帶來正義。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂不灰心也不沮喪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到祂在地上設立正義。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾海島都仰望祂的訓誨。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"創造諸天、鋪展穹蒼、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"鋪設大地和地上的一切、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"賜給世人生命氣息的耶和華上帝說：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我耶和華憑公義呼召你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必扶持你，保護你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你做我與眾民立約的中保、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成為列國的光，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你開盲人的眼睛、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從監牢中釋放囚犯、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"領出坐在黑暗中的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是耶和華，這就是我的名字。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不會把我的榮耀給假神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不會把我當受的讚美給雕刻的偶像。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，以前的預言都已應驗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我現在要宣告新的預言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把還未發生的事告訴你們。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["讚美主的歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"航海的和海中的一切、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾海島和島上的居民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要向耶和華高唱新歌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從地極讚美祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"曠野和其中的城邑以及基達人居住的村莊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要一同揚聲頌讚。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西拉的居民要歌唱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在山頂歡呼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要把榮耀歸給耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在眾海島上頌讚祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華像出征的勇士，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像鬥志激昂的戰士。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必高呼吶喊，戰勝仇敵。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝應許幫助以色列人"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"「我已沉默多時，我克制不語，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在我要像分娩的婦人一樣喊叫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"氣喘吁吁。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使大山小丘一片荒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上面的草木都枯萎。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使河川變成島嶼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"池塘乾涸。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要帶領盲人走他們不認識的路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"引導他們走陌生的道。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把他們面前的黑暗變為光明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"坎坷之地變得平坦。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必行這些事，我必不離棄他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但那些信靠雕刻的偶像、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"供奉金屬鑄像的必敗退，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"羞愧難當。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列眼瞎耳聾"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"「耳聾的人啊，聽吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眼瞎的人啊，看吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有誰比我的僕人更瞎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"比我差遣的使者更聾呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有誰像那些與我立約的人那樣瞎呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有誰像耶和華的僕人那樣瞎呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們看見許多事卻不領會，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耳朵開著卻聽不見。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華樂意使祂的律法尊大榮耀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好彰顯祂的公義。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但這些百姓飽受劫掠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都被困在坑中，囚在監內。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們淪為俘虜，無人搭救；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被當作戰利品擄走，無人追回。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們當中誰肯專心聽呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以後誰肯留心傾聽呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰把雅各交給了擄掠者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使以色列任人劫掠？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道不是我們得罪的耶和華嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們不肯遵行祂的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不聽從祂的訓誨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，祂把烈怒和戰火傾倒在他們身上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們被火包圍，卻不明白；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被烈火焚身，卻不在乎。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/42.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/43.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/41.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":25}